# 三、解决字段映射问题

你文档里面有一个冲突：

数据库：

```
max_people
```

Java：

```
maxPeople
```

MyBatis 默认不会自动识别。

所以后面 Mapper SQL 必须写：

```sql
max_people AS maxPeople
```

例如：

```sql
SELECT
activity_id AS activityId,
title,
description,
max_people AS maxPeople,
deadline,
create_user_id AS createUserId,
create_time AS createTime

FROM activity;
```

这样不用改实体。


